sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant MCP as Vista MCP
    participant RS as RalphService
    participant CM as ContainerManager
    participant CRED as CredentialMounter
    participant Docker as Docker Daemon
    participant Container as Docker Container

    User->>MCP: ralph_start(task, sandbox=true)
    MCP->>RS: create_job(task, sandbox=true)

    RS->>CM: check_docker_available()
    CM->>Docker: ping()
    Docker-->>CM: OK

    RS->>CM: ensure_image()
    CM->>Docker: images.get("vista-ralph:latest")
    alt Image not found
        CM->>Docker: images.build(dockerfile)
        Docker-->>CM: image built
    end

    RS->>RS: create job directory<br/>write task.md, PROMPT.md
    RS->>RS: generate bash loop.sh<br/>(Linux variant)

    RS->>CRED: get_mounts(host_os)
    CRED-->>RS: mount specs<br/>(~/.claude, ~/.ssh, etc.)

    RS->>CM: create_container(image, mounts, labels)
    Note over CM: Single project mount covers<br/>job dir (.vista/ralph/job/)
    CM->>Docker: containers.create(<br/>  image, volumes, labels,<br/>  auto_remove=true)
    Docker-->>CM: container_id

    CM->>Docker: container.start()
    Docker->>Container: execute loop.sh

    RS-->>MCP: job_id, container_id
    MCP-->>User: Job started (sandboxed)

    loop Dashboard polling
        Container->>Container: agent writes output.log<br/>(shared volume)
        User->>RS: get_job_status(job_id)
        RS->>RS: read output.log from<br/>host filesystem
        RS-->>User: parsed activity + sandbox badge
    end

    alt User stops job
        User->>MCP: ralph_stop(job_id)
        MCP->>RS: stop_job(job_id)
        RS->>CM: stop_container(container_id)
        CM->>Docker: container.stop()
        Docker->>Container: SIGTERM
        Note over Container: auto-removed
    else Job completes naturally
        Container->>Container: loop.sh exits
        Note over Container: auto-removed
    else TTL expires
        Docker->>Container: force stop
        Note over Container: auto-removed
    end
